---
import Section from '../layout/Section.astro';
---

<Section id="info" background="white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16 py-16 md:py-20 lg:py-24">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-12 md:mb-16 fade-in-up">
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-black uppercase mb-6 md:mb-8 leading-tight tracking-tight">
        Todo lo que<br />Necesitas Saber
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl text-center mb-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-dark fade-in-up leading-relaxed px-4" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
        Información importante sobre ubicación, horarios y preguntas frecuentes 
        para que disfrutes al máximo del festival.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Layout de dos columnas -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-12 lg:gap-16 mb-12 md:mb-16">
      
      <!-- Columna Izquierda - Ubicación -->
      <div class="fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div class="bg-white-warm border-[4px] border-black shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] p-6 md:p-8 mb-6">
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-6 text-black uppercase leading-tight">
            📍 Ubicación
          </h3>
          <div class="mb-6">
            <p class="font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl mb-2 text-black font-bold">
              El Faro, San Mateo
            </p>
            <p class="font-body text-base md:text-lg text-dark">
              Manabí, Ecuador
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="space-y-4 mb-6">
            <div class="border-[3px] border-black p-4 bg-yellow shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] transform hover:-translate-x-[1px] hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] transition-all">
              <p class="font-heading text-sm md:text-base font-bold text-black uppercase mb-2">Desde Quito:</p>
              <p class="font-body text-sm md:text-base text-black font-medium">6 horas vía Santo Domingo - Pedernales</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="border-[3px] border-black p-4 bg-orange shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] transform hover:-translate-x-[1px] hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] transition-all">
              <p class="font-heading text-sm md:text-base font-bold text-black uppercase mb-2">Desde Guayaquil:</p>
              <p class="font-body text-sm md:text-base text-black font-medium">3.5 horas vía Jipijapa - Puerto Cayo</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="border-[3px] border-black p-4 bg-pink shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] transform hover:-translate-x-[1px] hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] transition-all">
              <p class="font-heading text-sm md:text-base font-bold text-black uppercase mb-2">Desde Manta:</p>
              <p class="font-body text-sm md:text-base text-black font-medium">1 hora por la Ruta del Spondylus</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
      </div>

      <!-- Columna Derecha - FAQs -->
      <div class="fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.25s;">
        <div class="bg-white-warm border-[4px] border-black shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] p-6 md:p-8">
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-6 text-black uppercase leading-tight">
            ❓ Preguntas<br />Frecuentes
          </h3>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <details class="bg-yellow border-[3px] border-black p-4 shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] cursor-pointer group transform hover:-translate-x-[1px] hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] transition-all">
              <summary class="font-heading text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-black uppercase cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>¿Cuánto cuesta la inscripción?</span>
                <span class="text-black text-xl group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
              </summary>
              <p class="font-body mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-black leading-relaxed font-medium">
                $10 por categoría. Puedes inscribirte en múltiples categorías si cumples con los requisitos.
              </p>
            </details>

            <details class="bg-orange border-[3px] border-black p-4 shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] cursor-pointer group transform hover:-translate-x-[1px] hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] transition-all">
              <summary class="font-heading text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-black uppercase cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>¿Hay alojamiento disponible?</span>
                <span class="text-black text-xl group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
              </summary>
              <p class="font-body mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-black leading-relaxed font-medium">
                San Mateo cuenta con hostales, hoteles y opciones de camping. 
                Se recomienda reservar con anticipación durante el festival.
              </p>
            </details>

            <details class="bg-pink border-[3px] border-black p-4 shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] cursor-pointer group transform hover:-translate-x-[1px] hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] transition-all">
              <summary class="font-heading text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-black uppercase cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>¿Necesito llevar mi propia tabla?</span>
                <span class="text-black text-xl group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
              </summary>
              <p class="font-body mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-black leading-relaxed font-medium">
                Sí, los competidores deben traer su propio equipamiento. 
                Hay stands con alquiler disponible para práctica.
              </p>
            </details>

            <details class="bg-yellow border-[3px] border-black p-4 shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] cursor-pointer group transform hover:-translate-x-[1px] hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] transition-all">
              <summary class="font-heading text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-black uppercase cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>¿El evento es solo para competidores?</span>
                <span class="text-black text-xl group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
              </summary>
              <p class="font-body mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-black leading-relaxed font-medium">
                ¡No! El festival es abierto al público. Espectadores, familias 
                y turistas son bienvenidos. Hay actividades para todos.
              </p>
            </details>

            <details class="bg-orange border-[3px] border-black p-4 shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] cursor-pointer group transform hover:-translate-x-[1px] hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(26,26,26,1)] transition-all">
              <summary class="font-heading text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-black uppercase cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>¿Qué debo traer?</span>
                <span class="text-black text-xl group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
              </summary>
              <p class="font-body mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-black leading-relaxed font-medium">
                Protección solar biodegradable, sombrero, lentes de sol, 
                ropa ligera, toalla, traje de baño extra, agua reutilizable 
                y efectivo (no todos los stands aceptan tarjetas).
              </p>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</Section>
